1
00:00:41,679 --> 00:00:43,439
Those easily let into someone's home,

2
00:00:43,719 --> 00:00:44,880
besides acquaintances,

3
00:00:45,159 --> 00:00:46,920
are delivery drivers and couriers.

4
00:00:47,359 --> 00:00:48,439
Perhaps a courier

5
00:00:48,439 --> 00:00:49,280
went to Wu Qimeng's place.

6
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,320
Definitely.

7
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,640
Wu Qimeng had a housekeeper,

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
and her place was always kept tidy.

9
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,159
Someone like her

10
00:00:56,159 --> 00:00:58,119
would usually unpack packages right away.

11
00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:59,439
She wouldn't leave them for so long.

12
00:01:01,359 --> 00:01:03,399
The package in the house wasn't opened,

13
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:04,799
meaning she didn't have time to open it.

14
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:06,680
I'll check the records of couriers

15
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:07,879
coming and going during the crime window.

16
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,439
Well,

17
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,359
Looks like Captain Lu won't get a taste.

18
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,920
How's it looking?

19
00:01:26,879 --> 00:01:27,760
After 8:30,

20
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:28,920
men entering the compound,

21
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,519
besides residents,

22
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:31,920
included four couriers and deliverymen.

23
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:34,120
But coming out of the compound,

24
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,439
there were only three.

25
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:39,519
Staring at this footage is blinding me.

26
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,359
That soothes your throat, not your eyes.

27
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:45,680
As for our eyes,

28
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:47,079
we'll just have to tough it out.

29
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:48,400
Sync a copy quickly

30
00:01:48,519 --> 00:01:49,959
and send it to Gu Yan's team.

31
00:01:50,359 --> 00:01:51,480
Right away, Captain Lu.

32
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,040
Four went in,

33
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,519
but only three came out.

34
00:02:01,159 --> 00:02:03,439
The courier couldn't have just vanished.

35
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:08,439
Lu Yuan.

36
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:11,199
Gu Yan, through the waybill,

37
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:13,120
we identified who delivered to Wu Qimeng.

38
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,879
While delivering in the compound,

39
00:02:15,039 --> 00:02:16,039
we arrested him.

40
00:02:16,199 --> 00:02:17,439
I sent you his photo.

41
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,000
It's not him.

42
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,800
Are you sure?

43
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,560
His build doesn't match

44
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,039
the missing courier on surveillance.

45
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,240
Question him again.

46
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:39,240
Did you deliver to the compound yesterday?

47
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:39,800
Talk!

48
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:42,719
Yesterday... Yesterday, it was...

49
00:02:42,719 --> 00:02:44,479
my distant relative who delivered them.

50
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,400
Damn it.

51
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,879
Did he cause trouble again?

52
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,400
Know about the pregnant woman's murder?

53
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,240
Your relative is a prime suspect.

54
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:53,120
What?

55
00:02:53,439 --> 00:02:54,960
No wonder...

56
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:57,240
He texted me last night,

57
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,400
saying he couldn't do the job anymore

58
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,960
and was heading home to visit friends.

59
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,240
What's his name?

60
00:03:01,439 --> 00:03:02,759
How did he leave?

61
00:03:02,759 --> 00:03:03,840
When did he leave?

62
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,960
Where's his hometown?

63
00:03:05,439 --> 00:03:07,240
He's... he's my cousin.

64
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,120
His name is Yang Xiaotian.

65
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,560
His hometown is Cangzhou.

66
00:03:10,159 --> 00:03:11,639
I really don't know anything else!

67
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:12,960
I didn't ask!

68
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:15,120
Quick, back to the station and pull up

69
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,240
Yang Xiaotian's travel and lodging logs!

70
00:03:16,599 --> 00:03:17,319
Let's go!

71
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:18,120
Move!

72
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:26,400
So only Yang Xiaotian vanished.

73
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,199
He probably took off his uniform

74
00:03:28,199 --> 00:03:29,240
and left the compound in plain clothes.

75
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:33,879
Lu Yuan.

76
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:35,520
Yang Xiaotian has a prior arrest for theft.

77
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,000
Struggled to find work,

78
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:39,439
so he delivered under his relative's name.

79
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:40,680
It matches your profile.

80
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:42,919
So far, train station

81
00:03:42,919 --> 00:03:44,479
and highway toll booth surveillance

82
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:47,360
shows no travel records for Yang Xiaotian.

83
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,479
It's been 12 hours since the murder.

84
00:03:49,639 --> 00:03:50,520
Now that the nanny reported it

85
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,400
and the media exposed it,

86
00:03:51,479 --> 00:03:53,159
he's likely gone into hiding.

87
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,360
We also can't rule out

88
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,319
that he used illegal means

89
00:03:55,319 --> 00:03:56,280
to leave Ancheng.

90
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,680
Yang Xiaotian is currently

91
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,039
the prime suspect in this case.

92
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:01,120
Since the media is covering the story,

93
00:04:01,439 --> 00:04:02,800
let's leave Yang Xiaotian

94
00:04:02,919 --> 00:04:03,960
nowhere to hide.

95
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:06,639
In the heinous murder

96
00:04:06,639 --> 00:04:07,400
of pregnant woman Wu Qimeng,

97
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,240
the police have made progress

98
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,319
and issued a notice:

99
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:12,199
A 50,000 yuan reward for anyone who spots

100
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:13,240
and reports the suspect,

101
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,639
Yang Xiaotian.

102
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:26,240
Leaving the area during the crime window

103
00:04:26,439 --> 00:04:28,800
and matching Yang Xiaotian's silhouette,

104
00:04:28,959 --> 00:04:30,160
there are two people.

105
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:32,240
From the notes I just took,

106
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,040
the first person left the complex

107
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,639
at 8:50.

108
00:04:35,879 --> 00:04:36,759
The second person

109
00:04:37,199 --> 00:04:38,480
appeared at 9:40.

110
00:04:38,519 --> 00:04:40,800
Both fall within the crime window.

111
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,439
Still,

112
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:44,240
for the first person,

113
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,160
wouldn't that crime window

114
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,560
be a bit too tight?

115
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,120
You're right.

116
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,480
Looking at the timeline,

117
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:55,079
the second person is more suspicious.

118
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,240
But look at the first person's behavior.

119
00:04:57,399 --> 00:04:58,480
Acting all secretive,

120
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,920
pulling his cap low,

121
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,040
and when he came out,

122
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:03,000
deliberately facing away from the camera.

123
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,839
The victim's best friend, Wang Lili, said

124
00:05:04,839 --> 00:05:07,120
the victim was alive at 8:30.

125
00:05:07,959 --> 00:05:10,079
If that first person was Yang Xiaotian,

126
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:11,839
then in just 20 minutes,

127
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:12,720
he'd have had to commit rape,

128
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,360
murder, clean the body,

129
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,079
change clothes, and flee the scene.

130
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,079
Besides, if that first person

131
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:18,360
really is Yang Xiaotian,

132
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,560
doesn't that prove

133
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,759
Wang Lili is lying?

134
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:23,120
If it's a premeditated repeat offender,

135
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:24,639
they could pull it off quickly.

136
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,720
I gave information on both to Lu Yuan.

137
00:05:27,079 --> 00:05:28,639
Their movements after leaving the area...

138
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:29,560
he'll investigate them.

139
00:05:29,959 --> 00:05:31,759
As for who's lying,

140
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,680
we can only tell

141
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,720
after we catch Yang Xiaotian.

142
00:05:35,319 --> 00:05:37,480
Though Yang Xiaotian hasn't been caught

143
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,399
and the pressure is huge,

144
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,920
either way,

145
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:43,120
our work for today

146
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,160
is all wrapped up.

147
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:46,040
Come on, let's grab some food.

148
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:47,560
It's your first day on the job.

149
00:05:47,839 --> 00:05:49,319
Don't act like we're best friends.

150
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:50,560
Does being close even matter?

151
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:52,199
What matters is when you get home,

152
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:53,319
can you cook,

153
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:54,800
and do you have food to eat?

154
00:05:55,439 --> 00:05:56,800
Well, aren't you conscientious?

155
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:57,639
Of course.

156
00:05:57,759 --> 00:06:00,160
Standard procedure for a top assistant.

157
00:06:00,399 --> 00:06:01,160
Standard procedure.

158
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,279
Sigh, all right.

159
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:05,959
So, what are we eating?

160
00:06:16,879 --> 00:06:18,959
Pretty down-to-earth, right?

161
00:06:19,439 --> 00:06:21,759
This is the most authentic spot around.

162
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,040
Granny!

163
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:26,439
Oh my, my dear girl!

164
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,800
What happened to you?

165
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:30,240
I accidentally took a fall.

166
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,160
It'll heal in a couple of days.

167
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,439
Granny, rice noodles, the usual.

168
00:06:33,439 --> 00:06:34,079
Mildly spicy, please.

169
00:06:34,199 --> 00:06:34,800
Sure thing!

170
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:36,079
Hey, Granny.

171
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,079
She can't have spicy food right now.

172
00:06:38,279 --> 00:06:39,319
Don't listen to him.

173
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:42,199
Oh my, what a handsome young man!

174
00:06:42,439 --> 00:06:43,839
He's so tall, too.

175
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,519
And looks so thoughtful.

176
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,800
You really found yourself a great guy.

177
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:48,560
Wait, no...

178
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,000
Hey, Granny,

179
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,879
your husband must've been a catch too.

180
00:06:50,879 --> 00:06:52,720
I can tell that in your youth, Granny,

181
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,040
you must have been a real beauty.

182
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:57,240
A gorgeous lady, truly stunning!

183
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:59,519
Oh, you're such a sweet talker!

184
00:07:00,519 --> 00:07:01,680
You two sit tight.

185
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,360
Granny will...

186
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:04,399
bring you something delicious in a minute!

187
00:07:04,399 --> 00:07:04,920
Alright!

188
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:06,879
Oh, Granny,

189
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:08,439
make mine extra spicy!

190
00:07:08,439 --> 00:07:09,480
Okay!

191
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,600
You stopped me from explaining on purpose.

192
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:17,160
Explain what?

193
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,279
Explain that I'm not your boyfriend,

194
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:20,759
but your husband?

195
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:22,240
If you're my husband,

196
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,480
then what about my boyfriend?

197
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:26,240
You?

198
00:07:26,759 --> 00:07:28,120
When did you get a boyfriend?

199
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,079
How come I didn't know?

200
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:32,160
Do I need to report everything to you?

201
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:37,160
Here you go, eat up!

202
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,759
Eat it while it's hot.

203
00:07:38,759 --> 00:07:39,399
Thank you, Granny.

204
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:40,439
Yanyan, ever since she was little,

205
00:07:40,439 --> 00:07:42,399
has always loved eating here.

206
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:43,720
Granny,

207
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,720
A-Yan told me just now

208
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:47,959
that she brought her ex-boyfriend here.

209
00:07:49,079 --> 00:07:51,839
Oh, don't you believe her!

210
00:07:51,839 --> 00:07:53,720
You're the very first young man

211
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:55,519
she has ever brought here to eat!

212
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:03,160
Your boyfriend isn't all that, huh?

213
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:05,519
He really can't compare to a husband.

214
00:08:06,279 --> 00:08:08,600
My boyfriend is doing his PhD abroad,

215
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,000
so he couldn't come.

216
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:10,920
Just hurry up and eat.

217
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:11,680
Don't waste my time.

218
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:12,879
I'm in a hurry to get home.

219
00:08:12,959 --> 00:08:14,160
Right, right, right.

220
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:16,720
Then what's your boyfriend's name?

221
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:19,199
Which prestigious university abroad?

222
00:08:19,199 --> 00:08:20,920
What fancy major is he studying?

223
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,360
How tall is he?

224
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,480
How much does he weigh?

225
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,480
Let's see how you make this up.

226
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,720
His name and private details...

227
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,800
I won't disclose.

228
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:32,279
He studies finance at University of London

229
00:08:32,279 --> 00:08:34,799
busy working while doing his PhD.

230
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:37,480
She's telling the truth.

231
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:39,759
Except that person is my best friend,

232
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:41,480
not a single lie.

233
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,480
Nothing special.

234
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:45,039
Just so-so.

235
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:46,600
Looks like my assistant making two grand

236
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,600
isn't so simple either.

237
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:55,879
Usually, supermarkets

238
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,120
and shops have surveillance cameras.

239
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:01,200
If Yang Xiaotian wanted to hide,

240
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,840
a place like this...

241
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,159
What?

242
00:09:05,399 --> 00:09:07,159
Still thinking about your boyfriend abroad?

243
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,759
I just think this place

244
00:09:08,879 --> 00:09:10,039
is a perfect hiding spot for a suspect.

245
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:12,840
I brought you here to test our luck.

246
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,960
Looks like something's really going on.

247
00:09:20,399 --> 00:09:21,559
Is this fun to you?

248
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,120
Can't you have a little patience?

249
00:09:32,759 --> 00:09:33,480
Stop right there!

250
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:34,600
Stop!

251
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,240
Don't run!

252
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,360
It's Yang Xiaotian!

253
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,240
Stop eating!

254
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:40,600
No rush.

255
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,440
Stop! Don't run!

256
00:09:43,639 --> 00:09:44,639
Stop right there!

257
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,279
You've got the wrong guy!

258
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,360
Wrong guy!

259
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:56,840
Don't move!

260
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,799
I've been framed!

261
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,919
Framed!
